Crusaders of Might and Magic/
crusaders of might and magic/
original/
installer/
setup_*.exe
*.exe
*.dll
*.asi
*.m3d
*.tsk
*.bik
*.dat
*.msg
*.lnk

# Local User Assets & Pipeline Directories
local/
assets/original/
assets/extracted/
assets/generated/
assets/imported/
client/public/game-assets/
client/dist/game-assets/

# Proprietary Game File Formats (Crusaders of Might and Magic)
*.mdl
*.msh
*.ctx
*.czx
*.ani
*.cap
*.stg
